Description: Abseil random_internal_randen library
URL: https://abseil.io/
Version: 20260817
Requires: absl_random_internal_platform = 20260817, absl_random_internal_randen_hwaes = 20260817, absl_random_internal_randen_slow = 20260817
Libs: -L${libdir}  -labsl_random_internal_randen 
Cflags: -I${includedir} -DNOMINMAX
